#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:335
msgid ".. image:: /images/clouds/aws/invoiceCosting/7morphConfig.png"
msgstr ""

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:337
msgid "Save changes to your cloud integration."
msgstr "Speichern Sie die Änderungen an Ihrer Cloud-Integration."

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/aws/amazon.rst:339
msgid ""
"It may take as long as one hour for |morpheus| to process the next CUR "
